{"text":{"en":{"유패킹 SKY형":"U-Packing SKY Type","<p class=\"eyebrow\">U-Packing SKY Type</p> <h2>유패킹 SKY형</h2> <p>피스톤·로드 겸용으로 사용하는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">U-패킹 SKY형</strong>입니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">U-Packing SKY Type</p> <h2>U-Packing SKY Type</h2> <p>This is the <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">U-Packing SKY type</strong>, used for both piston and rod applications.</p>","<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/u_packing_sky_diagram.webp?v=wm1\" alt=\"U-Packing SKY형 도면\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=내경 · D=외경 · H=높이</span></p>":"<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/u_packing_sky_diagram.webp?v=wm1\" alt=\"U-Packing SKY type drawing\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ Cross-section diagram<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=inner diameter · D=outer diameter · H=height</span></p>","서울 구로구 경인로53길 32, 미래에코타워 B101·102호":"B101–102, Mirae Eco Tower, 32 Gyeongin-ro 53-gil, Guro-gu, Seoul"},"ja":{"유패킹 SKY형":"UパッキンSKY形","<p class=\"eyebrow\">U-Packing SKY Type</p> <h2>유패킹 SKY형</h2> <p>피스톤·로드 겸용으로 사용하는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">U-패킹 SKY형</strong>입니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">U-Packing SKY Type</p> <h2>UパッキンSKY形</h2> <p>ピストン・ロッド兼用として使用する<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">UパッキンSKY形</strong>です。</p>","<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/u_packing_sky_diagram.webp?v=wm1\" alt=\"U-Packing SKY형 도면\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=내경 · D=외경 · H=높이</span></p>":"<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/u_packing_sky_diagram.webp?v=wm1\" alt=\"UパッキンSKY形図面\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 断面図<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=内径・D=